r such as Freedom Scientific's screen reader JAWS.","pdf":"aeacc/oracle-apex-accessibility-guide.pdf","html":"aeacc/index.html","category":"Other"},{"title":"Oracle APEX Administration Guide","description":"Describes how to perform administration tasks for an Oracle APEX workspace, application, or an entire development instance.","pdf":"aeadm/oracle-apex-administration-guide.pdf","html":"aeadm/index.html","category":"Other"},{"title":"Oracle APEX API Reference","description":"Describes the Application Programming Interfaces, referred to as APIs, available when programming in the Oracle APEX environment.","pdf":"aeapi/oracle-apex-api-reference.pdf","html":"aeapi/index.html","category":"Other"},{"title":"Oracle APEX App Builder User's Guide","description":"Functions as a comprehensive, task-based reference on using the Oracle APEX development environment. Oracle APEX is a low-code development platform that enables you to build scalable, secure apps with world-class features that can be deployed anywhere.","pdf":"htmdb/oracle-apex-app-builder-users-guide.pdf","html":"htmdb/index.html","category":"Other"},{"title":"Oracle APEX End User's Guide","description":"Explains common Oracle APEX end user tasks.","pdf":"aeeug/oracle-apex-end-users-guide.pdf","html":"aeeug/index.html","category":"Other"},{"title":"Oracle APEX Installation Guide","description":"Explains how to install Oracle APEX and describes issues to consider before installing.","pdf":"htmig/oracle-apex-installation-guide.pdf","html":"htmig/index.html","category":"Other"},{"title":"Oracle APEX JavaScript API Reference","description":"This section describes the JavaScript APIs available to Oracle APEX applications. You can use these functions to provide client-side functionality, such as showing and hiding page elements, or making Ajax (Asynchronous JavaScript and XML) requests.","html":"aexjs/index.html","category":"Other"},{"title":"Oracle APEX Licensing Information User Manual","description":"Provides information on licenses and notices for third party technology that may be included or distributed with Oracle APEX.","pdf":"aelim/oracle-apex-licensing-information-user-manual.pdf","html":"aelim/index.html","category":"Other"},{"title":"Oracle APEX Release Notes","description":"Contains important information not included in the Oracle APEX documentation.","pdf":"htmrn/oracle-apex-release-notes.pdf","html":"htmrn/index.html","category":"Other"},{"title":"Oracle APEX SQL Workshop Guide","description":"Describes how to use Oracle APEX SQL Workshop and utilities to load and unload data from an Oracle database, generate DDL, view object reports, and restore dropped database objects.","pdf":"aeutl/oracle-apex-sql-workshop-guide.pdf","html":"aeutl/index.html","category":"Other"}]}